  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nA = (2, 3)\n\nB = (8, 3)\n\nC = (5, 9)\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nCentroid = ((x1 + x2 + x3) ÷ 3 , (y1 + y2 + y3) ÷ 3)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n⇒ x = (2 + 8 + 5) ÷ 3\n\n⇒ x = 15 ÷ 3 = 5\n\n⇒ y = (3 + 3 + 9) ÷ 3\n\n⇒ y = 15 ÷ 3 = 5\n\n**∴ The correct answer is (5, 5).**",
